# MCP deploy debug artifacts at the repo root. Dumps of function source and CLI
# output from the old MCP deploy route (deploys use the Supabase CLI now); 65 of
# these sat untracked and unignored, one `git add -A` from being committed.
# Root-anchored so nothing inside src/ or supabase/ can match.
/*deploy*.json
/.*deploy*
/*-mcp-args.json
/mcp-*.json
/.mcp-*
/.tmp-*
/.hp.html
